The enrichment fetch needs `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`, which the node's `with` clause doesn't grant (only `state-rw`), so I removed it. The node's component can import only what the clause grants. To add the fetch, the `with` clause itself has to be extended to include `http-client`. The output is unchanged, and `recorded` is a `u32`, so `recorded >= 0` always holds.

